B.cba=new A.b7("Productivity","Output per input","A team completed 240 cases using 30 staff-days.","Divide comparable output by a clearly defined input unit.","The team processed an average of 8 cases per staff-day.","","","","","Check case complexity and quality; higher throughput alone may not mean better performance.",null)
